   # rkward-0.5.0d-test1 (kde4)
   # for official ubuntu packages of R:
  deb http://reaktanz.de/deb/rkward intrepid main
   # for CRAN packages of R:
  [yet to come]

 ### packages for ubuntu 8.04 (hardy heron)
  ## rkward-0.5.0d-test1 (kde4)
   # for official ubuntu packages of R:
  deb http://reaktanz.de/deb/rkward hardy main
   # for CRAN packages of R:
  deb http://reaktanz.de/deb/rkward-cran hardy main
  ## rkward-0.4.9b-test1 (kde3)
   # for official ubuntu packages of R:
  deb http://reaktanz.de/deb/rkward-kde3 hardy main
   # for CRAN packages of R:
  deb http://reaktanz.de/deb/rkward-kde3-cran hardy main

hint: you need only *one* of these, depending on your installation...

please let me know if you run into problems, but also if it works! it should, 
actually, they all worked on their own test system. but i'd like to have some 
